This project is a C# port of algorithms and file-format handling found in the
following third-party software. Their notices are reproduced or referenced here
as required by their licenses.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
jbig2enc (https://github.com/agl/jbig2enc)

  Copyright 2006 Google Inc. All Rights Reserved.
  Author: Adam Langley (agl@imperialviolet.org)

  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Ported components: the JBIG2 arithmetic (MQ) encoder and integer/IAID
  encoding procedures (jbig2arith.cc), generic region encoding with TPGD,
  segment/file/page structure writing (jbig2enc.cc, jbig2structs.h,
  jbig2segments.h), symbol dictionary and text region encoding (jbig2sym.cc),
  the symbol equivalence test used for automatic thresholding
  (jbig2comparator.cc) and the multi-page symbol sharing logic.

  jbig2enc's own notice states: "This software is a description of processes
  which may be patented. Use of this software may require patent licenses in
